# =====================================================================
.Trash-*
*.tmp
*.temp

# =====================================================================
#  Broken LFS pointers from upstream Windows clone
# =====================================================================
# These 6 vendor texture files are LFS POINTERS without local content
# (130-byte placeholders, not the actual binary blobs). They block
# `git push` with "Git LFS upload failed: (missing)". The Mac port does
# NOT load them (Path A catalog + MEU Runner shim bypass the
# AAAKernel/Texture/ tree per c142-C inventory). Ignored so the push
# succeeds ; files remain on disk locally for reference. To recover the
# real binaries, fetch from the upstream Windows AAASeed LFS endpoint.
vendor/aaaseed-runtime/AAAKernel/Texture/Capture/silhouette_01.TGA
vendor/aaaseed-runtime/AAAKernel/Texture/Capture/silhouette_02.TGA
vendor/aaaseed-runtime/AAAKernel/Texture/Capture/silhouette_03.TGA
vendor/aaaseed-runtime/AAAKernel/Texture/Capture/silhouette_04.TGA
vendor/aaaseed-runtime/AAAKernel/Texture/Capture/silhouette_05.TGA
vendor/aaaseed-runtime/AAAKernel/Texture/FromNeHe/The Abyss.JPG

# =====================================================================
#  Per-contributor / local-only directories (intentional team choice)
# =====================================================================
.claude/
.claude-task-state/
books/
instructions/
memory/